# AI Transparency Statement

*Everything here is written by me.*

Not because I'm against using AI, but because there is an implicit contract between a writer and a reader, where the reader should be safe to assume that the writer took their time to understand what they are writing about, because they *respect the time the reader invest in reading*.

Given how everyone is swarmed by AI generated content with no thoughts or quality behind it, I don't want to contribute to that. I've tried to use it for editing and reviewing posts, but I learned that it made the whole task of writing dreadfully boring and the end-result lacking my personality in it. I choose to preserve my sometimes weird ways of phrasing and any other quirk of my writing.

I *do*, however, use it for research and learning about new stuff since it proved itself to be incredibly useful for those tasks.

